# AgentCarry 忽略规则
# 正式资产与本地派生物分离：本地敏感、缓存、快照、日志永不进入 Git。

# 本地敏感内容（隐私正文、导入收件箱、本地说明）：忽略内容，只保留目录占位。
.assistant-private/*
!.assistant-private/.gitkeep
!.assistant-private/assets/
.assistant-private/assets/*
!.assistant-private/assets/.gitkeep
!.assistant-private/inbox/
.assistant-private/inbox/*
!.assistant-private/inbox/.gitkeep

# 派生/缓存/快照/临时事务：忽略内容，只保留预定义空目录占位。
.assistant-local/*
!.assistant-local/.gitkeep
!.assistant-local/dashboard/
.assistant-local/dashboard/*
!.assistant-local/dashboard/.gitkeep
!.assistant-local/skills/
.assistant-local/skills/*
!.assistant-local/skills/.gitkeep
!.assistant-local/indexes/
.assistant-local/indexes/*
!.assistant-local/indexes/.gitkeep
!.assistant-local/upgrade-inbox/
.assistant-local/upgrade-inbox/*
!.assistant-local/upgrade-inbox/.gitkeep
!.assistant-local/task-handoffs/
.assistant-local/task-handoffs/*
!.assistant-local/task-handoffs/.gitkeep

# 临时升级副本、回滚副本、操作日志与缓存
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
*~
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
_tools/
dashboard/npm-install.log
dashboard/preview.log

# 维护者本地 Agent／Skill 工具链，不属于 Agent Carry 运行时或可携带资产。
# 根目录的 AGENTS.md 是正式入口，不受这些目录规则影响。
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json

# 编辑器与系统垃圾
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# 凭据与密钥（常见模式）
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.env
.env.*
credentials*
secrets*
*.secret
.npmrc
.pypirc
.netrc
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
service-account*.json
*-service-account.json

# 本地隐私迁移包与脱敏检查报告（即使误放回工作区也不进入 Git）
agent-carry-private-*.zip
agent-carry-body-*.zip
agent-carry-private-*.tar
agent-carry-private-*.tar.gz
/MIGRATION-MANIFEST.toml
/CHECKSUMS.sha256
/START-RESTORE.md
git-safety-report*

# 交付产物
dist/
build/

# 看板最终产物必须随仓库分发，用户才能直接双击离线打开。
!dashboard/dist/
!dashboard/dist/**
